'''Pujol''' ({{Literal translation|small hill}}), is the historic capital of [[Tartessia]], within the [[Hesperia|Hesperia community]]. In the [[2025 Baliscan census|2025 census]], the communal population was 330,812 people, making it the x-most populous in [[Baliscan Confederation|Balisca]]. 

